{"{n} colors":"{n} 種顏色","Fill every color quota to win. Some stages limit your moves or time — unused moves and fast finishes earn bonus points.":"填滿每個顏色配額即可獲勝。有些階段限制你的動作或時間——未使用的動作和快速完成可以獲得獎勵積分。","Tap a group of two or more touching cubes of the same color to pop it. Bigger groups score more.":"點擊一組兩個或更多相同顏色的接觸立方體以彈出它。更大的團體得分較高。","This group fills a goal color.":"此組填滿目標顏色。","A new color joins the wall: grape.":"一種新顏色加入牆壁：葡萄紫。","Rockets are the fastest way to fill two colors at once.":"火箭是同時填滿兩種顏色的最快方法。","The sixth color: tangerine. The wall gets busier.":"第六種顏色：橘紅色。牆壁變得更加忙碌。","MASTERY: six colors, tight budget.":"掌握：六種顏色，預算緊張。","Six-Color Squeeze":"六色擠壓","Only three colors — giant groups and bombs everywhere. 14 moves, no undo.":"只有三種顏色－巨型群體和炸彈無所不在。 14 步，不可撤銷。","Four colors in 90 seconds. No undo.":"90秒內四種顏色。無法撤銷。","Cubes of the same color stick together. Tap any group of 2 or more matching cubes to pop them. Try it now — any group works.":"相同顏色的立方體會黏在一起。點擊任何 2 個或更多匹配立方體的群組來彈出它們。現在試試——任何群組都可以。","That move is not allowed.":"該步移動不被允許。","Popped {n} cubes.":"爆開的{n}立方體。","Rocket forged.":"火箭鍛造。","Rocket fired.":"火箭發射。","Bomb forged.":"炸彈已鍛造。","Bomb exploded.":"炸彈爆炸了。","Chain of {n} specials.":"{n} 個特殊連鎖。","Board reshuffled.":"棋盤已重新洗牌。","Move undone.":"已復原移動。","Hint shown.":"顯示提示。","Stage complete.":"階段完成。","Round over.":"回合結束。","Wave {n} complete.":"波{n}完成。","Achievement unlocked.":"成就已解鎖。","Goal filled.":"目標已達成。","15 seconds left.":"剩餘 15 秒。","{keys} (reset)":"{keys}(重設)","(unlock at {n}★)":"（在 {n}★ 解鎖）","Tutorial reset. Lesson 1 is ready.":"教程重置。第 1 課已準備就緒。","Reset journey stars, achievements, and saved rounds?":"重置旅程星星、成就和已儲存回合？","Progress reset.":"進度已重置。","{n} moves":"{n} 步","endless":"無盡","Finish the previous stage to unlock.":"完成前一階段即可解鎖。","done":"完成","Seed {seed}":"種子 {seed}","no move limit":"無移動限制","Your best today: {n} points":"您今天的最佳成績：{n} 分","New challenge in {h}h {m}m (server-synced).":"{h}h {m}m（伺服器同步）中的新挑戰。","offline-capable":"能夠離線","Playing as {name}":"以 {name} 身分遊玩","progress synced":"進度已同步","saving…":"儲存中…","cloud sync unavailable":"雲端同步不可用","No scores on this device yet today.":"今天此設備上還沒有分數。","{score} pts · wave {wave}":"{score} 積分·波{wave}","No runs yet.":"尚未運作。","Pop groups":"流行團體","Tap a connected group of 2 or more matching cubes to pop them. Popped cubes count toward the goals on the left.":"點擊一組相連的2個或更多相符的立方體以彈出它們。彈出的方塊計入左側的進球。","Rockets":"火箭","A group of 5+ leaves a rocket on the tapped cube. Tap the rocket to clear its whole row or column. Taller groups make column rockets; wider groups make row rockets.":"一組5個以上會在被點擊的方塊上留下一個火箭。點擊火箭可清除其所在的整行或整列。更高的組合產生列火箭；更寬的組合產生行火箭。","Bombs":"炸彈","A group of 8+ leaves a bomb. Tap it to clear a 3×3 area around it.":"一組8個以上會留下一個炸彈。點擊它可清除周圍3×3的區域。","Chains":"連鎖","Blasts that touch other specials set them off too. Each extra special in one move earns a chain bonus.":"爆炸接觸到其他特殊方塊時也會引爆它們。一次移動中每個額外的特殊方塊都會獲得連鎖獎勵。","Goals and limits":"目標與限制","No dead ends":"無死角","If no legal move remains, the wall reshuffles itself for free.":"如果沒有剩餘合法移動，牆將免費重新洗牌。","Assists":"輔助","Where allowed: H shows a hint, U undoes your last pop. Challenges may disable them.":"在允許的情況下：H顯示提示，U撤銷您的最後一次彈出。挑戰可能會使他們喪失能力。","{color} row rocket":"{color}排火箭","{color} column rocket":"{color}柱式火箭","{color} bomb":"{color}炸彈","{color}, group of {n}":"{color}，{n}組","Row {r} column {c}: {desc}":"行{r}列{c}：{desc}","empty":"空白","Daily {date}":"每日 {date}","Fill the goals to win.":"填寫目標即可獲勝。","How to play":"玩法說明","Bigger groups score more.":"更大的群組得分更多。","Fill every goal to clear the stage.":"完成每個目標以清除舞台。","{n} cubes in poppable groups.":"可彈出組中的{n}立方體。","Fire a special to continue.":"發射特殊訊號以繼續。","Pop!":"噗！","That cube is not in a group of {n} or more.":"此立方體不在{n}或更多的組別中。","That cell is empty.":"該格為空。","That cell is outside the wall.":"該牢房位於牆外。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","Popped {n} {color} cubes. Score {score}.":"彈出{n} {color}立方體。得分 {score}。","No moves left — the wall reshuffled.":"沒有剩餘的移動－牆重新洗牌。","Wave {n} complete. New goals, +{moves} moves in the bank.":"波{n}完成。新目標，+{moves} 在銀行移動。","Achievement: {name}":"成就：{name}","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"已解鎖成就：{name}","All goals complete!":"所有目標完成！","Out of moves":"步數用盡","Time is up":"時間到","Round resigned":"回合已放棄","Round over":"回合結束","Lesson complete: {title}":"課程完成：{title}","You win — {reason}":"你贏了－{reason}","Cubes cleared ({n})":"立方體已清除（{n}）","Group size bonus":"團體規模獎金","Specials forged ({n})":"特價鍛造（{n}）","Chain bonus (best ×{n})":"連鎖獎勵（最佳 ×{n}）","Unused moves":"未使用的動作","Time under par":"低於標準桿的時間","Wave bonus ({n})":"波獎金（{n}）","Total":"總計","Round over. {reason} Score {score}.":"結束。 {reason} 得分 {score}。","Saved — rank #{rank} on this device ({score} pts).":"已儲存 — 在此裝置上排名#{rank}（{score} 分）。","Could not save ({error}).":"無法保存（{error}）。","Paused. Round saved locally.":"暫停。回合保存在本地。","Paused.":"已暫停。","Resumed.":"已繼續。","Journey {done}/{total} · {stars} stars · {ach}/{achTotal} achievements":"旅程 {done}/{total} · {stars} 星星 · {ach}/{achTotal} 成就","Play: {name}":"玩：{name}","Play: Journey":"玩：旅程","Row {r} column {c}, {color} special":"行{r} 列{c}、{color}專用","Row {r} column {c}, {color}, group of {n}":"行{r}，列{c}，{color}，組{n}","Camera reset.":"鏡頭已重置。","Replay copied.":"已複製重播。","Select the replay text to copy.":"選擇要複製的重播文字。","Hints are disabled in this mode.":"此模式已停用提示。","This group forges a bomb.":"該組織偽造了炸彈。","This group forges a rocket.":"這個小組鍛造了火箭。","Firing this special starts a chain.":"發射這個特別節目會引發連鎖反應。","This is the biggest group.":"這是最大的組別。","Fire this special.":"發射這個特殊的。","Try here.":"在這裡試試。","Hint: row {r} column {c}. {why}":"提示：行{r}列{c}。 {why}","Hint: {why}":"提示：{why}","Nothing to undo.":"沒有可復原的動作。","Move undone. Score {score}.":"移動撤銷。得分 {score}。","No saved round.":"沒有儲存回合。","Round resumed.":"回合已繼續。","{score} pts ({moves} moves, goals complete)":"{score} 分（{moves} 動作，目標完成）","{score} pts ({moves} moves)":"{score} 分（{moves} 移動）","Resume saved round":"繼續已儲存的回合","Journey":"旅程","Daily Challenge":"每日挑戰","Practice":"練習","Challenge":"挑戰","Score Chase":"分數追逐","Learn":"學習","Achievements":"成就","Settings":"設定","Help":"說明","Forty authored stages. Finish a stage to unlock the next; mastery stages test combined mechanics.":"四十個創作階段。完成一個階段即可解鎖下一個階段；掌握階段測驗組合力學。","Back":"返回","Play today's challenge":"參加今天的挑戰","Today's board (this device)":"今日棋盤（本設備）","Unranked. Undo and hints allowed. No effect on ratings.":"未排名。允許撤銷和提示。對收視率沒有影響。","Challenges":"挑戰","Constrained goals: move limits, speed targets, restricted tools.":"受限目標：步數限制、速度目標、限制工具。","Score Chase — Endless Wall":"分數追逐 — 無盡的牆","Start run":"開始運行","Your best runs (local)":"您的最佳跑步成績（本地）","Interactive lessons. Each one asks you to perform the rule yourself.":"互動課程。每個規則都要求您自己執行該規則。","Audio":"音訊","Show text captions for sounds":"顯示聲音的文字標題","Studio theme":"工作室主題","Accessibility":"協助工具","Left-handed action tray":"左手操作列","Progress":"進度","Replay tutorial":"重播教學","Reset all progress":"重置所有進度","Controls":"控制","Action":"操作","Keyboard":"鍵盤","Pointer / touch":"指針/觸摸","Move selection":"移動選擇","Pop / fire":"流行/火","Tap a group":"點選一組","Hint":"提示","Hint button":"提示按鈕","Undo":"復原","Undo button":"撤銷按鈕","Pause":"暫停","Pause button":"暫停按鈕","Orbit camera":"軌道相機","Drag the board":"拖曳板","Goals":"目標","Score":"分數","Moves":"步數","Time":"時間","Wave":"波次","Move bank":"行動銀行","Camera":"攝影機","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Restart round":"重新開始回合","Leave round":"離開回合","Results":"結果","Display name":"顯示名稱","Save to today's board":"保存到今天的看板","Retry":"重試","Next":"下一個","Menu":"選單","Copy replay envelope":"複製重播包","Cherry":"櫻桃","Lemon":"檸檬","Leaf":"葉子","Sky":"天空","Grape":"葡萄","Tangerine":"橘子","Sunny Studio":"陽光工作室","Mint Workshop":"造幣車間","Twilight Loft":"暮光閣樓","Candy Corner":"糖果角落","Ivory Attic":"象牙閣樓","First Pops":"第一次流行","Tap any group of 2+ matching cubes to pop them. Fill the goals on the left.":"點擊任何一組 2 個以上匹配的立方體即可彈出它們。填寫左側的目標。","Bigger is Better":"越大越好","Bigger groups score more. Hunt for the largest cluster.":"更大的群組得分更多。尋找最大的群集。","New: pop 5+ cubes at once to forge a rocket. Tap a rocket to clear its whole line.":"新功能：一次彈出 5 個以上的立方體來鍛造火箭。點擊火箭以清除其整條線。","Move Budget":"移動預算","New: a move limit. Every tap must count.":"新：移動限制。每一次點擊都必須計數。","Tall Orders":"艱鉅的任務","Bombs Away":"炸彈飛走","New: pop 8+ cubes for a bomb that clears everything around it.":"新：彈出 8 個以上立方體即可獲得炸彈，清除周圍的一切。","Chain Reaction":"連鎖反應","Blasts trigger other specials. Set up chains for huge scores.":"爆炸會觸發其他特殊方塊。設置連鎖以獲得巨大分數。","Corner Pocket":"角落袋","Grape Arrives":"葡萄到達","Toy Chest":"玩具箱","MASTERY: everything so far, on a bigger wall.":"掌握：到目前為止的一切，在更大的牆上。","Wide Wall":"寬牆","Rocket Rally":"火箭拉力賽","Thin Ice":"薄冰","Bomb Squad":"炸彈小隊","Beat the Clock":"擊敗時鐘","New: a time limit instead of a move limit. Pop briskly.":"新：時間限製而不是移動限制。輕快地流行起來。","Tangerine Twist":"橘子麻花","Full Spectrum":"全光譜","Pressure Play":"壓力遊玩","Double Trouble":"雙重麻煩","Studio Floor":"工作室地板","Grand Wall":"長城","The big wall: eight columns wide.":"大牆：八根柱寬。","Sky Harvest":"天豐","One huge sky quota, with a leaf side order.":"一個巨大的天空配額，帶有葉側訂單。","Clockwork Pop":"發條爆爆","Rocket Science":"火箭科學","Deep Reserve":"深度儲備","Blast Furnace":"高爐","Narrow Margin":"毫釐之差","Speed Shelf":"速度架","Heavy Mix":"重混","Grand Parade":"盛大遊行","MASTERY: the full toy studio at once.":"掌握：立即完成完整的玩具工作室。","Chain Gang":"連鎖幫派","Blitz Wall":"閃電牆","Rocket Rain":"火箭雨","Bomb Voyage":"炸彈之旅","Tight Squeeze":"緊密空間","Long Haul":"長途跋涉","Time Crunch":"時間緊迫","Master Budget":"大師預算","Cube Carnival":"立方體嘉年華","MASTERY: the definitive wall. Good luck.":"掌握：最終的牆。祝你好運。","Two-Tone Tangle":"雙音纏結","Speed Pop":"速度流行","Frugal Fingers":"節儉手指","Nine moves, no assists. Plan every pop.":"九次移動，無助攻。計劃好每一次流行。","Bomb Brigade":"炸彈旅","Bombs come easier (7+). Two big quotas.":"炸彈來得更容易（7+）。兩個大配額。","Rocket Season":"火箭賽季","Rockets come easier (4+), bombs are off the menu.":"火箭變得更容易（4+），炸彈不再出現。","Grand Constraint":"大師限制","Move limit, time limit, no assists. The full test.":"步數限制、時間限制、無輔助。完整考驗。","Casual":"休閒","Apprentice":"學徒","Expert":"專家","Endless Wall":"無盡的牆","Goals keep coming in waves. Each wave banked adds moves — play until the bank runs dry.":"目標不斷出現。每波堆積都會增加步數——玩到堤岸耗盡為止。","One shared seed for everyone, today only.":"所有人共用一個種子，僅限今日。","Pop a group":"彈出一組","Forge a rocket":"鍛造火箭","Groups of 5 or more leave a rocket behind. Pop the big cherry cluster in the middle — the cube you tap becomes the rocket.":"5 人或以上的團體留下一枚火箭。彈出中間的大櫻桃簇——你點擊的立方體就變成了火箭。","Fire a rocket":"發射火箭","A rocket sits on the wall. Tap it to clear its whole row or column in one blast.":"火箭在牆上。點擊它以一次爆炸清除整行或整列。","Chain reaction":"連鎖反應","Two rockets share a row. Fire one — its blast sets off the other. Chained specials earn big bonus points.":"兩枚火箭共用一排。發射一顆－它的爆炸會引爆另一顆。連鎖特價可賺取巨額獎勵積分。","Make a bomb":"製作炸彈","Groups of 8 or more leave a bomb that clears everything around it. Pop the huge cherry cluster to forge one.":"8 人或更多人組成的小組留下一枚炸彈，清除周圍的一切。彈出巨大的櫻桃簇來鍛造一個。","Finish the stage":"完成階段","The goal rail (left) asks for 2 cherry cubes. Pop the cherry pair to complete the stage — that is a win.":"球門欄桿（左）需要 2 個櫻桃方塊。彈出櫻桃對來完成舞台——這是一場勝利。","Second chances":"第二次機會","In relaxed modes you can undo a pop (U) or ask for a hint (H). Pop any group, then undo it to finish the lesson.":"在輕鬆模式下，您可以撤銷彈出(U)或要求提示(H)。彈出任何組，然後撤消它以完成課程。","First Pop":"第一次流行","Pop your first group of cubes.":"彈出你的第一組立方體。","Goal Getter":"進球者","Complete all goals in a stage.":"完成一個關卡中的所有目標。","Rocketeer":"火箭手","Forge your first rocket.":"打造你的第一枚火箭。","Demolitionist":"拆除者","Forge your first bomb.":"鍛造你的第一枚炸彈。","Chain Artist":"連鎖藝術家","Fire 3+ specials in a single move.":"單步發射 3 個以上特殊技能。","Crowd Pleaser":"取悅群眾","Pop a group of 12 or more cubes.":"彈出一組12個或更多的立方體。","Cube Veteran":"立方體老手","Clear 1000 cubes in total.":"總共清除 1000 個方塊。","Half the Journey":"旅程過半","Finish 20 journey stages.":"完成 20 個旅程關卡。","Studio Master":"工作室大師","Finish all 40 journey stages.":"完成所有 40 個旅程階段。","Regular":"一般","Finish 7 daily challenges.":"完成 7 個每日挑戰。","High Shelf":"高處","Score 3000+ in a single round.":"在單一回合中獲得 3000+ 分。","Music, effects and voice volumes and mute are in the StarHermit Options.":"音樂、效果和語音音量以及靜音都在 StarHermit 選項中。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Graphics":"圖形","Graphics quality, render scale and frame rate are in the StarHermit Options.":"圖形品質、渲染比例和幀率請見 StarHermit 選項。","Reduced motion, high contrast (with the high-contrast cube palette) and text size are in the StarHermit Options.":"減少運動、高對比(使用高對比立方體調色板)和文字大小在StarHermit選項中。","Change keys and buttons":"變更按鍵與按鈕","Reset":"重置","Cancel":"取消"}
